Repair site iFixit today shared a teardown of Apple's new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/airpods-max/">AirPods Max 2</a> headphones, and as expected, there are few changes. iFixit says the &zwnj;AirPods Max 2&zwnj; are "basically the same" as the original AirPods Max headphones that came out in 2020.<br/>
<br/>
